  "statement": "I acknowledge the support for merging RES-01 with TRU-03 to enhance data protection compliance and I also agree to merging SAF-06 with TRU-01 for streamlined user authentication. However, I maintain that EFF-05 and RES-05 should remain separate as they serve distinct purposes for efficiency and accountability in overdue notifications. I continue to support TRU-02 for auditability, which is crucial for maintaining trust in the system. Lastly, I oppose modifications to EFF-02; the limit on simultaneous borrow operations is essential for optimizing resource utilization while maintaining security.",
